sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MobileApp as Mobile App (Hardware Enclave)
    participant Keystore as Android Keystore / iOS Keychain
    participant Backend as Backend API Service
    participant Database as PostgreSQL DB

    MobileApp->>Keystore: Generate Ed25519 Identity Keypair
    Keystore-->>MobileApp: Return Public Key (Private Key locked in Enclave)
    MobileApp->>Keystore: Generate Signed Prekey + Sign with Identity Key
    MobileApp->>Keystore: Generate 100 One-Time Prekeys (OTPs)
    MobileApp->>Backend: POST /api/v1/keys/prekey (Public Identity + Signed Prekey + One-Time Public Keys)
    Backend->>Database: Store Public Key Bundles in device_key_bundles
    Database-->>Backend: Confirmed Stored
    Backend-->>MobileApp: 201 Created (Key Bundle Published)
